POST {{base}}/properties/{{t6.response.body.id}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "authorName": "Ana", "content": "   " }

### Sin nombre -> 400
POST {{base}}/properties/{{t6.response.body.id}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Hola" }

### Propiedad que no existe -> 404
POST {{base}}/properties/9999/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "authorName": "Ana", "content": "Hola" }

### Comentar un borrador (todavia no es publico) -> 404
# @name t7draft
POST {{base}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
