POST {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}/visit-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requesterName": "Maria Gomez", "requesterPhone": "011-4444-4444", "proposedAt": "2020-01-01T10:00:00-03:00" }

### Fecha sin zona horaria -> 400
POST {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}/visit-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requesterName": "Maria Gomez", "requesterPhone": "011-4444-4444", "proposedAt": "2027-03-15T15:00:00" }

