GET {{base}}/agencies/1/visit-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Filtrado por estado
GET {{base}}/agencies/1/visit-requests?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Sin token -> 401 (tiene datos de contacto: no es publico)
GET {{base}}/agencies/1/visit-requests

### Pedro (otro vendedor) mira las solicitudes de la inmobiliaria 1 -> 403
GET {{base}}/agencies/1/visit-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPedro.response.body.token}}

### Pendiente -> Realizada: invalida (tiene que pasar por Confirmada) -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

### Otro vendedor intenta confirmar -> 403
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPedro.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Otro vendedor intenta rechazar -> 403
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPedro.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "REJECTED" }

### Sin token -> 401
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Solicitud que no existe -> 404
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/9999/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Estado que no existe -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACEPTADA" }

### El dueño confirma -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Con una visita Confirmada, la propiedad NO se edita -> 409 (regla de la Tarea 5)
PUT {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "x", "description": "x", "type": "HOUSE", "operation": "SALE", "price": 1, "currency": "USD",
  "address": "x", "area": "x", "totalAreaM2": 45,
  "images": [{ "url": "https://example.com/a.jpg", "isCover": true }]
}

### ...ni se cancela -> 409 (regla de la Tarea 6)
PATCH {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELLED" }

### ...pero si admite otros cambios de estado -> 200 (pausar)
PATCH {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PAUSED" }

### ...y comentarios nuevos (aunque este pausada, sigue siendo publica) -> 201
POST {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "authorName": "Ana", "content": "¿Sigue disponible?" }

### Confirmada -> Confirmada: no es un cambio -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Confirmada -> Realizada -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

### Realizada es final -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELLED" }

### Ya no hay visita Confirmada: la propiedad (pausada) se puede editar de nuevo -> 200
PUT {{base}}/properties/{{t8.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Casa para visitas (editada)", "description": "x", "type": "HOUSE", "operation": "SALE", "price": 140000, "currency": "USD",
  "address": "Calle 7 700", "area": "Pilar", "totalAreaM2": 350,
  "images": [{ "url": "https://example.com/v.jpg", "isCover": true }]
}

### Rechazar una Pendiente -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v2.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "REJECTED" }

### Rechazada es final -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/visit-requests/{{v2.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Listado final: v1 REALIZADA, v2 RECHAZADA, con el titulo de la propiedad
GET {{base}}/agencies/1/visit-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

